\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 quase a certeza de que os dois tatearam a superf\'edcie da}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid8019957  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 plataforma rochosa, encontrand
