\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788  dignos}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid11493463  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 de toda a confian\'e7a. E as minhas convic\'e7\'f5es sobre o fen\'f4meno}{
\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid11493463  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 das apari\'e7\'f5es come\'e7aram a desmoronar-se. J}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid11493463 \'e1}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 
 n\'e3o estava t\'e3o}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid11493463  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 seguro de tudo ser pura imagina\'e7\'e3o, fruto da neurose de}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid11493463  }{
