\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid11493463 \'e1}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 tico seria esperar pelos}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid11493463  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 
