\par }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid11493463 \tab }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 Algu\'e9m, do outro lado da porta, me obrigou a}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid11493463  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 
