\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788  no}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 qual, com carateres mal tra\'e7ados, copiara as palavras }{
\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907 \endash }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788  ou}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 supostas palavras - do Galileu nessa nova apari
\'e7\'e3o.
\par }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907 \tab }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 Orgulhoso, mostrou aquela esp\'e9cie de ostraca e, adotando um}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907  }{
\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 tom solene leu as letras mal feitas com alguma pedra ou}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 objeto pontiagudo:
\par }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907 \tab }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 - A paz seja convosco. Ainda que o Filho do Homem tenha}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907  }{
\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 aparecido na terra entre os Judeus, trazia o seu mini}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907 s}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 t\'e9rio a}{
\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 todos os homens.}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 
\par }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907 \tab }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 O rapaz parecia ter problemas com a sua pr\'f3pria escrita}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907  }{
\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 apressada.
\par }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid2495907 \tab }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 - Que mais?
