\par \tab }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 A princ\'edpio,}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid7435597  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 obcecado com a id\'e9ia de n\'e3o causar inc\'f4modos, insinuei ao meu}{
\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid7435597  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 anfitri\'e3o que eu podia descansar junto }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid7435597 \'e0s}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788  }{
\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid7435597 cinzas}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 . O meu}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid7435597  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 manto tinha servido em ocasi\'f5
es semelhantes. Elias}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid7435597  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 zangou-se. E, puxando}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid7435597 -me}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 , res
