o - sem dar cr}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid12201448 \'e9}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 dito ao que surgia}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid12201448  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 
