\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid8085810 O encontro estava }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 chega}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid8085810 ndo}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788  ao fim. Mas, antes de}{
\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid8085810  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 nos despedirmos, Pilatos, numa demonstra\'e7\'e3o de agradecimento,}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid8085810  }{
