\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 infor}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid5059155 ma\'e7\'e3o, por ser, logicamente, an\'f4}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 nima, talvez tivesse sido}{
