\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid5059155 \'e1}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid5059155 s}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 er ratificado. Bastaria}{
