}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid397967  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 trago boas}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid397967 ; not\'edcias, j}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 \'e1 que te anuncio que a tu
a concep\'e7\'e3o}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid397967  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 foi ordenada pelo c\'e9u. A seu devido tempo ser}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid397967 \'e1}{
\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 s m\'e3e de um}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid397967  }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 filho, a quem por}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid397967 \'e1}{
\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 s o nome de Yehosua [Jesus ou "Jav}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid3360731 \'e9}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788  salva"]}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid397967  }{
\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 e que instaurar}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid397967 \'e1}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788   o reino dos c\'e9us na Terra e entre os}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid397967  
