cios delas, acompanh}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid3473472 \'e1}{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 -las at\'e9 }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid3473472 Filad\'e9lfia }{\lang1046\langfe1033\langnp1046\insrsid10184788 
